
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Howard Ragnar.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Howard Ragnar.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"erxmnl","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777009371099,"size":3454,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"erxmnl"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,17],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar":[19,36],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{1}":[21,29],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{2}":[30,30],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{3}":[31,31],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{4}":[32,32],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{5}":[33,34],"#Characters - Howard Ragnar#{6}":[35,36]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":55,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Howard","Ragnar","father"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Entry: Howard Ragnar, Consort to Matriarch Rachael Blakeney**\n\n**What it is:** A Valheimr warlord's son integrated as a devoted consort in a matriarchal Floran society. Represents a \"tamed beast\" archetype—a powerful warrior fulfilled by a loving, female-led dynamic rather than weakened by it.\n\n**When to select:** When the narrative involves Rachael's household, family dynamics, gender role interactions, Valheimr-Floran cultural contrasts, or Howard personally (as husband, father, or protector).\n\n**Key relationships:** Consort to Matriarch Rachael Blakeney. Lives within her estate and culture (Flora's society). Father to their children. His gruff exterior masks deep family loyalty. His warrior instincts are channeled into family defense and service."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Howard Ragnar.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"heknkw","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Howard Ragnar.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,17],"size":951,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
